{"sample_key": "autonomous_sources:r0:t1:closure_c1", "query": "\"In Search of an Understandable Consensus Algorithm\" raft github io pdf", "maximum": 20, "body_sha256": "ecf092b5f5939f117a366160906619fd9700e19e1b53afaca73e2dea4ddbbc82", "retrieved_at": "2026-10-04T11:17:36.825931+00:00", "body": {"query": "\"In Search of an Understandable Consensus Algorithm\" raft github io pdf", "results": [{"template": "default.html", "title": "In Search of an Understandable Consensus Algorithm", "content": "The result of this work is a consensus algorithm called Raft. In designing Raft we applied specic techniques to improve understandability, including decomposition (Raft separates leader election, log replication, and safety) and.", "img_src": "", "iframe_src": "", "audio_src": "", "thumbnail": "", "publishedDate": null, "pubdate": "", "length": null, "views": "", "author": "", "metadata": "", "priority": "", "engines": ["yandex"], "open_group": false, "close_group": false, "positions": [1], "score": 1.0, "category": "general", "url": "https://raft.github.io/raft.pdf", "engine": "yandex", "parsed_url": ["https", "raft.github.io", "/raft.pdf", "", "", ""]}, {"template": "default.html", "title": "raft.pdf", "content": "In Search of an Understandable Consensus Algorithm. (Extended Version).In order to enhance understandabil- ity, Raft separates the key elements of consensus, such as. leader election, log replication, and safety, and it enforces.", "img_src": "", "iframe_src": "", "audio_src": "", "thumbnail": "", "publishedDate": null, "pubdate": "", "length": null, "views": "", "author": "", "metadata": "", "priority": "", "engines": ["yandex"], "open_group": false, "close_group": false, "positions": [2], "score": 0.5, "category": "general", "url": "https://docs.google.com/viewer?url=https%3A%2F%2Fraft.github.io%2Fraft.pdf", "engine": "yandex", "parsed_url": ["https", "docs.google.com", "/viewer", "", "url=https%3A%2F%2Fraft.github.io%2Fraft.pdf", ""]}, {"template": "default.html", "title": "In Search of an Understandable Consensus Algorithm", "content": "The result of this work is a consensus algorithm called Raft. In designing Raft we applied specic techniques to improve understandability, including decomposition (Raft separates leader election, log replication, and safety) and.", "img_src": "", "iframe_src": "", "audio_src": "", "thumbnail": "", "publishedDate": null, "pubdate": "", "length": null, "views": "", "author": "", "metadata": "", "priority": "", "engines": ["yandex"], "open_group": false, "close_group": false, "positions": [3], "score": 0.3333333333333333, "category": "general", "url": "http://man6.org/blog/papers/In_Search_of_an_Understandable_Consensus_Algorithm.pdf", "engine": "yandex", "parsed_url": ["http", "man6.org", "/blog/papers/In_Search_of_an_Understandable_Consensus_Algorithm.pdf", "", "", ""]}, {"template": "default.html", "title": "Papers We Love San Diego - In Search of an Understandable...", "content": "Tech Talk - Raft, In Search of an Understandable Consensus Algorithm by Diego Ongaro. LinkedIn Engineering. 37K 11y ago.", "img_src": "", "iframe_src": "", "audio_src": "", "thumbnail": "", "publishedDate": null, "pubdate": "", "length": null, "views": "", "author": "", "metadata": "", "priority": "", "engines": ["yandex"], "open_group": false, "close_group": false, "positions": [4], "score": 0.25, "category": "general", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ATPtyGbmp34", "engine": "yandex", "parsed_url": ["https", "www.youtube.com", "/watch", "", "v=ATPtyGbmp34", ""]}, {"template": "default.html", "title": "In Search of an Understandable Consensus Algorithm", "content": "Raft is a consensus algorithm for managing a replicated log. It produces a result equivalent to (multi-)Paxos, and it is as efficient as Paxos, but its structure is different from Paxos; this makes Raft more understandable than Paxos and also provides a better foundation for building practical...", "img_src": "", "iframe_src": "", "audio_src": "", "thumbnail": "", "publishedDate": null, "pubdate": "", "length": null, "views": "", "author": "", "metadata": "", "priority": "", "engines": ["yandex"], "open_group": false, "close_group": false, "positions": [5], "score": 0.2, "category": "general", "url": "https://clio.limistah.dev/raft-paper", "engine": "yandex", "parsed_url": ["https", "clio.limistah.dev", "/raft-paper", "", "", ""]}, {"template": "default.html", "title": "In Search of an Understandable Consensus Algorithm | USENIX", "content": "In order to enhance understandability, Raft separates the key elements of consensus, such as leader election, log replication, and safety, and it enforces a stronger degree of coherency to reduce the number of states that must be considered.", "img_src": "", "iframe_src": "", "audio_src": "", "thumbnail": "", "publishedDate": null, "pubdate": "", "length": null, "views": "", "author": "", "metadata": "", "priority": "", "engines": ["yandex"], "open_group": false, "close_group": false, "positions": [6], "score": 0.16666666666666666, "category": "general", "url": "https://www.usenix.org/conference/atc14/technical-sessions/presentation/ongaro", "engine": "yandex", "parsed_url": ["https", "www.usenix.org", "/conference/atc14/technical-sessions/presentation/ongaro", "", "", ""]}, {"template": "default.html", "title": "(PDF) In Search of an Understandable Consensus Algorithm...", "content": "First page of “In Search of an Understandable Consensus Algorithm (Extended Version” PDF Icon.Raft is a consensus algorithm for managing a replicated log. It produces a result equivalent to (multi-)Paxos, and it is as efficient as Paxos, but its structure is different from Paxos...", "img_src": "", "iframe_src": "", "audio_src": "", "thumbnail": "", "publishedDate": null, "pubdate": "", "length": null, "views": "", "author": "", "metadata": "", "priority": "", "engines": ["yandex"], "open_group": false, "close_group": false, "positions": [7], "score": 0.14285714285714285, "category": "general", "url": "https://www.academia.edu/8510596/In_Search_of_an_Understandable_Consensus_Algorithm_Extended_Version", "engine": "yandex", "parsed_url": ["https", "www.academia.edu", "/8510596/In_Search_of_an_Understandable_Consensus_Algorithm_Extended_Version", "", "", ""]}, {"template": "default.html", "title": "RAFT - In Search of an Understandable Consensus Algorithm", "content": "A consensus algorithm is: a cluster of servers should record a series of records (\"log entries\") in response to requests from clients of the cluster. (It may also take action based on those entries.)", "img_src": "", "iframe_src": "", "audio_src": "", "thumbnail": "", "publishedDate": null, "pubdate": "", "length": null, "views": "", "author": "", "metadata": "", "priority": "", "engines": ["yandex"], "open_group": false, "close_group": false, "positions": [8], "score": 0.125, "category": "general", "url": "https://highscalability.com/raft-in-search-of-an-understandable-consensus-algorithm/", "engine": "yandex", "parsed_url": ["https", "highscalability.com", "/raft-in-search-of-an-understandable-consensus-algorithm/", "", "", ""]}, {"template": "default.html", "title": "Understanding the Raft consensus algorithm: an academic article...", "content": "This post summarizes the Raft consensus algorithm presented in the paper In Search of An Understandable Consensus Algorithm by Diego Ongaro and John Ousterhout. All pull quotes are taken from that paper.", "img_src": "", "iframe_src": "", "audio_src": "", "thumbnail": "", "publishedDate": null, "pubdate": "", "length": null, "views": "", "author": "", "metadata": "", "priority": "", "engines": ["yandex"], "open_group": false, "close_group": false, "positions": [9], "score": 0.1111111111111111, "category": "general", "url": "https://www.freecodecamp.org/news/in-search-of-an-understandable-consensus-algorithm-a-summary-4bc294c97e0d/", "engine": "yandex", "parsed_url": ["https", "www.freecodecamp.org", "/news/in-search-of-an-understandable-consensus-algorithm-a-summary-4bc294c97e0d/", "", "", ""]}, {"template": "default.html", "title": "In Search of an Understandable Consensus Algorithm - Klay Daily", "content": "Read it on raft.github.io. (opens in a new tab).Raft splits the problem into three pieces you can hold separately - leader election, log replication, and safety - and then insists that all writes flow through a leader so that the log is only ever appended to in one place.", "img_src": "", "iframe_src": "", "audio_src": "", "thumbnail": "", "publishedDate": null, "pubdate": "", "length": null, "views": "", "author": "", "metadata": "", "priority": "", "engines": ["yandex"], "open_group": false, "close_group": false, "positions": [10], "score": 0.1, "category": "general", "url": "https://klaylearn.com/daily/raft-consensus", "engine": "yandex", "parsed_url": ["https", "klaylearn.com", "/daily/raft-consensus", "", "", ""]}, {"template": "default.html", "title": "Reading/分布式系统/Raft/In Search of an Understandable...", "content": "In Search of an Understandable Consensus Algorithm (Extended Version) 2014. Diego Ongaro and John Ousterhout Stanford University.", "img_src": "", "iframe_src": "", "audio_src": "", "thumbnail": "", "publishedDate": null, "pubdate": "", "length": null, "views": "", "author": "", "metadata": "", "priority": "", "engines": ["yandex"], "open_group": false, "close_group": false, "positions": [11], "score": 0.09090909090909091, "category": "general", "url": "https://github.com/Uyouii/Reading/blob/master/%E5%88%86%E5%B8%83%E5%BC%8F%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9F/Raft/In%20Search%20of%20an%20Understandable%20Consensus%20Algorithm%20%28Extended%20Version%29.md", "engine": "yandex", "parsed_url": ["https", "github.com", "/Uyouii/Reading/blob/master/%E5%88%86%E5%B8%83%E5%BC%8F%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9F/Raft/In%20Search%20of%20an%20Understandable%20Consensus%20Algorithm%20%28Extended%20Version%29.md", "", "", ""]}, {"template": "default.html", "title": "Raft - In Search of an Understandable Consensus Algorithm", "content": "The interesting aspect of Raft is that its primary design goal is understandability. In the paper, the authors repeatedly says that another consensus algorithm, Paxos, is too difficult to understand. lol. I haven't studied Paxos yet, but one of my colleagues says it is exteremely difficult to grasp.", "img_src": "", "iframe_src": "", "audio_src": "", "thumbnail": "", "publishedDate": null, "pubdate": "", "length": null, "views": "", "author": "", "metadata": "", "priority": "", "engines": ["yandex"], "open_group": false, "close_group": false, "positions": [12], "score": 0.08333333333333333, "category": "general", "url": "https://www.hondaya.co/blog/raft", "engine": "yandex", "parsed_url": ["https", "www.hondaya.co", "/blog/raft", "", "", ""]}, {"template": "default.html", "title": "Paper Reading: In Search of an Understandable Consensus...", "content": "This paper is the paper to read about Raft consensus algorithm and a good way to build intuition for consensus algorithms in general.In an informal survey of attendees at NSDI 2012, we found few people who were comfortable with Paxos, even among seasoned researchers.", "img_src": "", "iframe_src": "", "audio_src": "", "thumbnail": "", "publishedDate": null, "pubdate": "", "length": null, "views": "", "author": "", "metadata": "", "priority": "", "engines": ["yandex"], "open_group": false, "close_group": false, "positions": [13], "score": 0.07692307692307693, "category": "general", "url": "https://yizhang82.dev/paper-raft", "engine": "yandex", "parsed_url": ["https", "yizhang82.dev", "/paper-raft", "", "", ""]}, {"template": "default.html", "title": "RAFT In Search of an Understandable Consensus Algorithm...", "content": "The document discusses the Raft consensus algorithm, highlighting its components such as leader election, log replication, and handling server states (leader, follower, candidate).", "img_src": "", "iframe_src": "", "audio_src": "", "thumbnail": "", "publishedDate": null, "pubdate": "", "length": null, "views": "", "author": "", "metadata": "", "priority": "", "engines": ["yandex"], "open_group": false, "close_group": false, "positions": [14], "score": 0.07142857142857142, "category": "general", "url": "https://www.slideshare.net/slideshow/raft-in-search-of-an-understandable-consensus-algorithm-presentation-ppt/253762716", "engine": "yandex", "parsed_url": ["https", "www.slideshare.net", "/slideshow/raft-in-search-of-an-understandable-consensus-algorithm-presentation-ppt/253762716", "", "", ""]}, {"template": "default.html", "title": "In Search of an Understandable Consensus Algorithm (2014) [pdf]", "content": "When this article proposes \"Raft vs Paxos\" they are actually comparing Raft against a standard way of configuring Paxos with a leader (MultiPaxos). Note that MultiPaxos allows a lot of nuances in the implementations while still being called \"MultiPaxos\".", "img_src": "", "iframe_src": "", "audio_src": "", "thumbnail": "", "publishedDate": null, "pubdate": "", "length": null, "views": "", "author": "", "metadata": "", "priority": "", "engines": ["yandex"], "open_group": false, "close_group": false, "positions": [15], "score": 0.06666666666666667, "category": "general", "url": "https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=23113419", "engine": "yandex", "parsed_url": ["https", "news.ycombinator.com", "/item", "", "id=23113419", ""]}], "answers": [], "corrections": [], "infoboxes": [], "suggestions": [], "unresponsive_engines": []}}
{"sample_key": "autonomous_sources:r0:t3:closure_c1", "query": "民航 旅客 携带 充电宝 乘机 规定 最新", "maximum": 20, "body_sha256": "0f69cab4766c4028a40b317fcc46adcf424433ca97e6e6ee5c5afc0f8871ed9e", "retrieved_at": "2026-10-04T11:18:27.183332+00:00", "body": {"query": "民航 旅客 携带 充电宝 乘机 规定 最新", "results": [{"template": "default.html", "title": "携带充电宝乘飞机莫大意！ 多家航司强调注意事项_腾讯新闻", "content": "强调旅客携带充电宝乘机规定，规范携带充电宝乘机行为。香港航空此前表示，因应国际民航组织（ICAO）及香港民航处的最新规定，香港航空对携带锂电池外置充电器（行动电源）实施进一步限制措施。", "img_src": "", "iframe_src": "", "audio_src": "", "thumbnail": "", "publishedDate": null, "pubdate": "", "length": null, "views": "", "author": "", "metadata": "", "priority": "", "engines": ["yandex"], "open_group": false, "close_group": false, "positions": [1], "score": 1.0, "category": "general", "url": "https://news.qq.com/rain/a/20260906A0BNKA00", "engine": "yandex", "parsed_url": ["https", "news.qq.com", "/rain/a/20260906A0BNKA00", "", "", ""]}, {"template": "default.html", "title": "充电宝乘机新规发布后，多家机场提供暂存服务", "content": "近期，民航局发布关于旅客携带充电宝乘机的通知要求。 目前，全国各大机场不仅加强了安检查验力度，也增设了充电宝查验台，方便旅客提前自检，部分机场还提供充电宝暂存服务。", "img_src": "", "iframe_src": "", "audio_src": "", "thumbnail": "", "publishedDate": null, "pubdate": "", "length": null, "views": "", "author": "", "metadata": "", "priority": "", "engines": ["yandex"], "open_group": false, "close_group": false, "positions": [2], "score": 0.5, "category": "general", "url": "https://xinwen.bjd.com.cn/content/s6867149fe4b0aabe0a032baa.html", "engine": "yandex", "parsed_url": ["https", "xinwen.bjd.com.cn", "/content/s6867149fe4b0aabe0a032baa.html", "", "", ""]}, {"template": "default.html", "title": "充电宝上飞机执行新规，大品牌不一定畅通无阻！ 这些细节都要检查", "content": "此外，充电宝不能托运，必须随身携带。 携带上飞机的充电宝也不能使用。 民航局之所以发布紧急通知，是因为今年以来，已经发生多起旅客携带充电宝等锂电池产品在机上起火冒烟事件。", "img_src": "", "iframe_src": "", "audio_src": "", "thumbnail": "", "publishedDate": null, "pubdate": "", "length": null, "views": "", "author": "", "metadata": "", "priority": "", "engines": ["yandex"], "open_group": false, "close_group": false, "positions": [3], "score": 0.3333333333333333, "category": "general", "url": "https://m.jfdaily.com/wx/detail.do?id=936567", "engine": "yandex", "parsed_url": ["https", "m.jfdaily.com", "/wx/detail.do", "", "id=936567", ""]}, {"template": "default.html", "title": "post.smzdm.com/p/agw9lw37", "content": "内容参考来源：#民航局禁无3C标识充电宝#【民航局：禁止旅客携带无3C标识及被召回的充电宝乘坐境内航班】#旅紧急通知！ 民航局：6月28日起禁带无3C标识及召回充电宝乘机", "img_src": "", "iframe_src": "", "audio_src": "", "thumbnail": "", "publishedDate": null, "pubdate": "", "length": null, "views": "", "author": "", "metadata": "", "priority": "", "engines": ["yandex"], "open_group": false, "close_group": false, "positions": [4], "score": 0.25, "category": "general", "url": "https://post.smzdm.com/p/agw9lw37/", "engine": "yandex", "parsed_url": ["https", "post.smzdm.com", "/p/agw9lw37/", "", "", ""]}, {"template": "default.html", "title": "bbs.fobshanghai.com/thread-5296656-1-133.html", "content": "民航局发布旅客携带“充电宝”乘机规定. “充电宝”（又称移动电源）如今已经成为很多人出行的必备品，但却很少有人知道，由于涉及到航空运输安全，民航对旅客携带“充电宝”乘机有着明确的规定。", "img_src": "", "iframe_src": "", "audio_src": "", "thumbnail": "", "publishedDate": null, "pubdate": "", "length": null, "views": "", "author": "", "metadata": "", "priority": "", "engines": ["yandex"], "open_group": false, "close_group": false, "positions": [5], "score": 0.2, "category": "general", "url": "https://bbs.fobshanghai.com/thread-5296656-1-133.html", "engine": "yandex", "parsed_url": ["https", "bbs.fobshanghai.com", "/thread-5296656-1-133.html", "", "", ""]}, {"template": "default.html", "title": "充电宝乘机新规首日，你的充电宝能否带上飞机？ 现场直击_北京时间", "content": "充电宝乘机新规首日，你的充电宝能否带上飞机？根据《关于民航旅客携带“充电宝”乘机规定的公告》： 充电宝只能在手提行李中携带或随身携带， 严禁在托运行李中携带。", "img_src": "", "iframe_src": "", "audio_src": "", "thumbnail": "", "publishedDate": null, "pubdate": "", "length": null, "views": "", "author": "", "metadata": "", "priority": "", "engines": ["yandex"], "open_group": false, "close_group": false, "positions": [6], "score": 0.16666666666666666, "category": "general", "url": "https://item.btime.com/41v8i91ponu8e9pnuojftmddbgs", "engine": "yandex", "parsed_url": ["https", "item.btime.com", "/41v8i91ponu8e9pnuojftmddbgs", "", "", ""]}, {"template": "default.html", "title": "m.nbd.com.cn/articles/2025-06-14/3908230.html", "content": "早在2014年民航局就发布了《关于民航旅客携带“充电宝”乘机规定的公告》，对在飞机上携带充电宝和锂电池作出如下规定： 一、充电宝必须是旅客个人自用携带。 二、充电宝只能在手提行李中携带或随身携带，严禁在托运行李中携带。", "img_src": "", "iframe_src": "", "audio_src": "", "thumbnail": "", "publishedDate": null, "pubdate": "", "length": null, "views": "", "author": "", "metadata": "", "priority": "", "engines": ["yandex"], "open_group": false, "close_group": false, "positions": [7], "score": 0.14285714285714285, "category": "general", "url": "https://m.nbd.com.cn/articles/2025-06-14/3908230.html", "engine": "yandex", "parsed_url": ["https", "m.nbd.com.cn", "/articles/2025-06-14/3908230.html", "", "", ""]}, {"template": "default.html", "title": "没带3c标识的充电宝能入境新加坡吗 - 今日头条", "content": "民航局关于充电宝的新规。 需要注意的是，新规定只针对充电宝。批准后方可携带，且每名旅客最多只能携带两个；超过160Wh的充电宝严禁携带上飞机。", "img_src": "", "iframe_src": "", "audio_src": "", "thumbnail": "", "publishedDate": null, "pubdate": "", "length": null, "views": "", "author": "", "metadata": "", "priority": "", "engines": ["yandex"], "open_group": false, "close_group": false, "positions": [8], "score": 0.125, "category": "general", "url": "https://www.toutiao.com/zixun/7521923105397508147/", "engine": "yandex", "parsed_url": ["https", "www.toutiao.com", "/zixun/7521923105397508147/", "", "", ""]}, {"template": "default.html", "title": "news.xmnn.cn/xmxw/202506/t20250628_350919.html", "content": "【链接】. 带充电宝乘机需遵守以下规定. 1.充电宝必须是旅客个人自用携带。 2.充电宝只能在手提行李中携带或随身携带，严禁在托运行李中携带。充电宝怎样辨认真假3C？", "img_src": "", "iframe_src": "", "audio_src": "", "thumbnail": "", "publishedDate": null, "pubdate": "", "length": null, "views": "", "author": "", "metadata": "", "priority": "", "engines": ["yandex"], "open_group": false, "close_group": false, "positions": [9], "score": 0.1111111111111111, "category": "general", "url": "https://news.xmnn.cn/xmxw/202506/t20250628_350919.html", "engine": "yandex", "parsed_url": ["https", "news.xmnn.cn", "/xmxw/202506/t20250628_350919.html", "", "", ""]}, {"template": "default.html", "title": "cqnews.net/1/detail/1388454975074172928/web/content...", "content": "什么是3C标识？ 对于携带充电宝上飞机还有哪些规定？ 3C标识长啥样？充电宝登机. 还需符合容量规定. 需要注意的是，可以登机的充电宝不仅要带有3C标识，而且要符合容量规定。 根据《关于民航旅客携带“充电宝”乘机规定的公告》：", "img_src": "", "iframe_src": "", "audio_src": "", "thumbnail": "", "publishedDate": null, "pubdate": "", "length": null, "views": "", "author": "", "metadata": "", "priority": "", "engines": ["yandex"], "open_group": false, "close_group": false, "positions": [10], "score": 0.1, "category": "general", "url": "https://www.cqnews.net/1/detail/1388454975074172928/web/content_1388454975074172928.html", "engine": "yandex", "parsed_url": ["https", "www.cqnews.net", "/1/detail/1388454975074172928/web/content_1388454975074172928.html", "", "", ""]}, {"template": "default.html", "title": "什么类型的充电宝不能“乘飞机”？ 进来看看吧", "content": "工作人员向旅客介绍携带充电宝乘机的规定. 那么，究竟什么类型的充电宝不能“乘飞机”了呢？充电宝；3C标识不清晰的充电宝；被召回型号或批次的充电宝。", "img_src": "", "iframe_src": "", "audio_src": "", "thumbnail": "", "publishedDate": null, "pubdate": "", "length": null, "views": "", "author": "", "metadata": "", "priority": "", "engines": ["yandex"], "open_group": false, "close_group": false, "positions": [11], "score": 0.09090909090909091, "category": "general", "url": "https://m.voc.com.cn/xhn/news/202507/29845317.html", "engine": "yandex", "parsed_url": ["https", "m.voc.com.cn", "/xhn/news/202507/29845317.html", "", "", ""]}, {"template": "default.html", "title": "明确了！ 这些充电宝，不能带上飞机", "content": "通知强调，各机场安检部门要加强对旅客随身携带充电宝查验，严防旅客携带不合格充电宝乘机。", "img_src": "", "iframe_src": "", "audio_src": "", "thumbnail": "", "publishedDate": null, "pubdate": "", "length": null, "views": "", "author": "", "metadata": "", "priority": "", "engines": ["yandex"], "open_group": false, "close_group": false, "positions": [12], "score": 0.08333333333333333, "category": "general", "url": "https://pub-zhtb.hizh.cn/s/202506/26/AP685ce76ee4b0ea3a79b655d0.html", "engine": "yandex", "parsed_url": ["https", "pub-zhtb.hizh.cn", "/s/202506/26/AP685ce76ee4b0ea3a79b655d0.html", "", "", ""]}, {"template": "default.html", "title": "163.com/dy/article/KAQ1A4LP0514A6ML.html", "content": "根据《关于民航旅客携带“充电宝”乘机规定的公告》： 1.额定能量限制：携带时充电宝应处于非工作状态(关闭电源）。 充电宝只能在手提行李中携带或随身携带，严禁托运。 选购充电宝时应认准3C标识. 登机时携带的充电宝.", "img_src": "", "iframe_src": "", "audio_src": "", "thumbnail": "", "publishedDate": null, "pubdate": "", "length": null, "views": "", "author": "", "metadata": "", "priority": "", "engines": ["yandex"], "open_group": false, "close_group": false, "positions": [13], "score": 0.07692307692307693, "category": "general", "url": "https://www.163.com/dy/article/KAQ1A4LP0514A6ML.html", "engine": "yandex", "parsed_url": ["https", "www.163.com", "/dy/article/KAQ1A4LP0514A6ML.html", "", "", ""]}, {"template": "default.html", "title": "tidenews.com.cn/news.html?id=3140059&from_channel=5d8b4d25cf...", "content": "用充电宝充电。04杭州萧山国际机场对携带充电宝坐飞机的规定与民航局保持一致，如有充电宝需随身携带，额定能05潮新闻记者曾关注航班上充电宝使用的相关规定，并采访了解到机场对携带充电宝的具体执行标准。", "img_src": "", "iframe_src": "", "audio_src": "", "thumbnail": "", "publishedDate": null, "pubdate": "", "length": null, "views": "", "author": "", "metadata": "", "priority": "", "engines": ["yandex"], "open_group": false, "close_group": false, "positions": [14], "score": 0.07142857142857142, "category": "general", "url": "https://tidenews.com.cn/news.html?id=3140059&from_channel=5d8b4d25cf8dfd0001a4143c&top_id=3140067", "engine": "yandex", "parsed_url": ["https", "tidenews.com.cn", "/news.html", "", "id=3140059&from_channel=5d8b4d25cf8dfd0001a4143c&top_id=3140067", ""]}, {"template": "default.html", "title": "51ldb.com/shsldb/ms/content/0197b113752cc0010000d7c90f012edc.htm", "content": "6月28日起，民航局针对旅客携带充电宝出台的最新规定将正式执行。近日，民航局发布新规：“自6月28日起禁止旅客携带没有3C标识、3C标识不清晰、被召回型号或批次的充电宝乘坐境内航班。”", "img_src": "", "iframe_src": "", "audio_src": "", "thumbnail": "", "publishedDate": null, "pubdate": "", "length": null, "views": "", "author": "", "metadata": "", "priority": "", "engines": ["yandex"], "open_group": false, "close_group": false, "positions": [15], "score": 0.06666666666666667, "category": "general", "url": "https://www.51ldb.com/shsldb/ms/content/0197b113752cc0010000d7c90f012edc.htm", "engine": "yandex", "parsed_url": ["https", "www.51ldb.com", "/shsldb/ms/content/0197b113752cc0010000d7c90f012edc.htm", "", "", ""]}], "answers": [], "corrections": [], "infoboxes": [], "suggestions": [], "unresponsive_engines": []}}
