iority": "", "engines": ["yandex"], "open_group": false, "close_group": false, "positions": [6], "score": 0.16666666666666666, "category": "general", "url": "https://item.btime.com/41v8i91ponu8e9pnuojftmddbgs", "engine": "yandex", "parsed_url": ["https", "item.btime.com", "/41v8i91ponu8e9pnuojftmddbgs", "", "", ""]}, {"template": "default.html", "title": "南通网", "content": "根据民航局发布的通知，自6月28日起禁止旅客携带没有3C标识、3C标识不清晰、被召回型号或批次的充电宝乘坐境内航班。 该规定是为了进一步保障民航和旅客出行安全，还请您予以理解和支持。", "img_src": "", "iframe_src": "", "audio_src": "", "thumbnail": "", "publishedDate": null, "pubdate": "", "length": null, "views": "", "author": "", "metadata": "", "priority": "", "engines": ["yandex"], "open_group": false, "close_group": false, "positions": [7], "score": 0.14285714285714285, "category": "general", "url": "https://www.ntrb.com.cn/content/2025-12/11/content_36781721.htm", "engine": "yandex", "parsed_url": ["https", "www.ntrb.com.cn", "/content/2025-12/11/content_36781721.htm", "", "", ""]}, {"template": "default.html", "title": "post.smzdm.com/p/agw9lw37", "content": "内容参考来源：#民航局禁无3C标识充电宝#【民航局：禁止旅客携带无3C标识及被召回的充电宝乘坐境内航班】#旅紧急通知！ 民航局：6月28日起禁带无3C标识及召回充电宝乘机", "img_src": "", "iframe_src": "", "audio_src": "", "thumbnail": "", "publishedDate": null, "pubdate": "", "length": null, "views": "", "author": "", "metadata": "", "priority": "", "engines": ["yandex"], "open_group": false, "close_group": false, "positions": [8], "score": 0.125, "category": "general", "url": "https://post.smzdm.com/p/agw9lw37/", "engine": "yandex", "parsed_url": ["https", "post.smzdm.com", "/p/agw9lw37/", "", "", ""]}, {"template": "default.html", "title": "ctdsb.net/c1716_202506/2469930.html", "content": "“禁带无3C标及被召回充电宝乘机”新规出台，天山机场提前施行，旅客安检时看到上百个不合规充电宝被拦截. 极目新闻 2025-06-26 17:12:19 阅读量：", "img_src": "", "iframe_src": "", "audio_src": "", "thumbnail": "", "publishedDate": null, "pubdate": "", "length": null, "views": "", "author": "", "metadata": "", "priority": "", "engines": ["yandex"], "open_group": false, "close_group":